      "text": "The repository is a collection of extensions for pi, a terminal-based coding agent, organized as multiple packages."
    },
    {
      "basis": "documented",
      "claim_id": "clm_8fce552c5447e492958c5ad8e83416edd0da3eb349766f7330e98164f59c800a",
