      "slice_ids": [
        "slc_b7463bf57ad78b82778b69507593e24c8819655205eca4252cf80e882aa20973"
      ],
      "text": "Packages include pi-minimal-footer (footer with context gauge and usage bars), pi-session-recall (search past sessions), pi-auto-permissions, pi-codex-subagents, pi-codex-compaction, and pi-herdr-worktree-jump, all marked as core usage."
    },
