        "slc_b7463bf57ad78b82778b69507593e24c8819655205eca4252cf80e882aa20973"
      ],
      "text": "Additional packages include pi-quit-and-delete and pi-ssh-tools (moderate tier) plus pi-fork-plus and pi-herdr (experimental tier); the pi-model-agents row is truncated so its tier is not evidenced."
